OL,3,GNEWSAVerbal abuse and spitting directed
OL,4,Aat road workers
OL,5,
OL,6,FA gas distributor says it has installed
OL,7,FCCTV cameras at a roadworks site after
OL,8,Fcontractors were verbally abused and
OL,9,Fspat at.
OL,11,FSGN reported installing the cameras
OL,12,Fwhile workers replaced a gas main under
OL,13,Fpart of Stockbridge Road in Chichester,
OL,14,FSussex.
OL,16,FContractors, particularly traffic
OL,17,Fmarshals at the closed road, have
OL,18,F"regularly experienced unacceptable
OL,19,Fbehaviour from drivers since work
OL,20,Fbegan", the company said.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
